[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8105.99, "timestamp": "02:15:05", "text": "所以，先拿到宝箱，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8107.99, "timestamp": "02:15:07", "text": "获得所有好东西，然后再推进"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8110.39, "timestamp": "02:15:10", "text": "剧情，这样很容易。 因为谁知道我什么时候会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8141.669, "timestamp": "02:15:41", "text": "是的，他实际上可以成为我的摇钱树。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8143.83, "timestamp": "02:15:43", "text": "他只要去招惹这些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8147.189, "timestamp": "02:15:47", "text": "豺狼，就能帮我赚钱。 但同时，他的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8151.91, "timestamp": "02:15:51", "text": "健康状况也在恶化。 我应该担心吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8154.629, "timestamp": "02:15:54", "text": "抱歉，AOD。 我要把你塑造成我的圣诞老人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8156.144, "timestamp": "02:15:56", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8157.75, "timestamp": "02:15:57", "text": "[笑声]"}]